[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.349, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "正常行事。除非我另有说明，否则一切照常进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9604.55, "timestamp": "02:40:04", "text": "否则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.389, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "那是你的呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9608.87, "timestamp": "02:40:08", "text": "这就像你的攻击检定。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9609.27, "timestamp": "02:40:09", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9610.55, "timestamp": "02:40:10", "text": "这就是你的头衔。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9612.23, "timestamp": "02:40:12", "text": "自动计算，但通常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9614.55, "timestamp": "02:40:14", "text": "结果是 1d20 加上你的熟练度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9617.349, "timestamp": "02:40:17", "text": "奖励加上你的呃修正值，因为自从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9619.349, "timestamp": "02:40:19", "text": "这是你的，这将是你的施法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9622.79, "timestamp": "02:40:22", "text": "修饰符。所以，是的，它会滚动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9625.03, "timestamp": "02:40:25", "text": "还有，呃，我会告诉你如果……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9626.63, "timestamp": "02:40:26", "text": "不管是否热门。如果我告诉你它击中了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9628.07, "timestamp": "02:40:28", "text": "你点击了损坏图标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9629.91, "timestamp": "02:40:29", "text": "聊天。上面写的是损坏，对吧？你点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9632.309, "timestamp": "02:40:32", "text": "上面那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9634.15, "timestamp": "02:40:34", "text": "呃，这个，哦，损坏。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9637.11, "timestamp": "02:40:37", "text": "是的，上面显示的是损坏。你点击它，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9641.03, "timestamp": "02:40:41", "text": "然后应该会弹出一个窗口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9643.349, "timestamp": "02:40:43", "text": "哦好的。我现在点击它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9644.71, "timestamp": "02:40:44", "text": "对，点击它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9645.75, "timestamp": "02:40:45", "text": "好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9648.309, "timestamp": "02:40:48", "text": "应该如此。然后点击“正常”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9649.99, "timestamp": "02:40:49", "text": "大多数情况下，除非是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9651.429, "timestamp": "02:40:51", "text": "关键时刻，你点击正常。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9652.87, "timestamp": "02:40:52", "text": "你的伤害骰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9655.27, "timestamp": "02:40:55", "text": "是的，一旦滚动完毕，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9657.03, "timestamp": "02:40:57", "text": "可以点击申请，然后就像交易一样。"}]